---
config:
  layout: elk
  look: neo
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  title: GUI-18 - Display voter registration bubble chart (preferred)
  actor User as User

  box Frontend
    participant landingPage as landingPage#58;DOMNode
    participant dropDown as dropDown#58;DOMNode
    participant stateMap as stateMap#58;DOMNode
    participant Axios as #58;Axios
  end

  box Backend
    participant Controller as #58;Controller
    participant Service as #58;Service
    participant Repository as #58;Repository
  end
  
  Note right of Repository: IStateDAO in codebase

  Note right of User: Visits state/{fipsCode}
  activate landingPage
  User ->> landingPage: Click State

  activate dropDown
  landingPage ->> dropDown: Render
  User ->> dropDown: Select 'Voter Registration' option
  Note left of dropDown: Specifically, the 'Registration Data' tab is clicked

  activate stateMap
  Note left of stateMap: The 'Bubblechart Overlay' tab is clicked
  dropDown ->> stateMap: Render

  Note right of stateMap: Orval used to generate typesafe request wrappers
  activate Axios
  stateMap ->> Axios: getCountyGeoUnitCentroids(fipsCode)
  stateMap ->> Axios: getVoterRegistrationCounts(fipsCode)

  activate Controller
  Axios ->> Controller: GET /state/${fipsCode}/centroids
  Axios ->> Controller: getCountyGeoUnitCentroids(fipsCode)
  Axios ->> Controller: GET /state/${fipsCode}/voter-registration-count
  Axios ->> Controller: getVoterRegistrationCounts(fipsCode)

  Note left of Controller: The Servlet + Jackson Serialization step is omitted for simplicity. <br> The full event flow is in our diagram for GUI-2: Display State
  
  activate Service
  Controller ->> Service: getCountyGeoUnitCentroids(fipsCode)
  Controller ->> Service: getVoterRegistrationCounts(fipsCode)

  activate Repository
  Service ->> Repository: getCountyGeoUnitCentroids(fipsCode)
  Service ->> Repository: getVoterRegistrationCounts(fipsCode)
  
  Note left of Repository: Calls into our custom ORM solution, performing row mapping <br> (simplified, full-flow in GUI-2: Display State)
  Repository -->> Service: Map<string, GeoUnitCentroidModel>
  Repository -->> Service: List<VoterRegistrationStatisticsModel>
  deactivate Repository
  
  Service -->> Controller: Map<string, GeoUnitCentroidModel>
  Service -->> Controller: List<VoterRegistrationStatisticsModel>
  deactivate Service

  Note left of Controller: Serialized into a JSON string
  Controller -->> Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
  Controller -->> Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
  deactivate Controller

  Axios -->> stateMap: Map<string, GeoUnitCentroidModel>
  Axios -->> stateMap: List<VoterRegistrationStatisticsModel>
  deactivate Axios
  deactivate stateMap
  Note left of Axios: Each bubble location is set from the server response<br>dictionary, and each bubble is styled using Leaflet
  Note left of Axios: The political party with the most registered voters is determined from the<br>server response object, and each bubble's color is set accordingly
  
  deactivate dropDown
  deactivate landingPage
  